{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/rena-avenew-dubai-islands","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1093,"crm_id":"2877","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Rena","slug":"rena-avenew-dubai-islands","display_address":"Dubai Islands","building_type":["apartment","duplex"],"completion_year":"2027","developer":"Avenew Properties","price":null,"display_price":null,"lattitude":25.3276899,"longitude":55.3082701,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Rena By <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-avenew-properties/\">Avenew </a>at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubai-islands/\">Dubai Islands</a> offers 64 exclusive units, featuring <strong>1 to 3-bedroom apartments and 2-bedroom duplex townhouses.</strong> Designed to blend modern elegance with coastal living, Rena reflects a lifestyle inspired by the sea. Positioned directly on the sand, it provides seamless access to the beach and panoramic ocean views. Each space brings the beauty of the ocean indoors, with gentle sea breezes and calming waves enhancing everyday life.</p><p>Located in the prestigious Dubai Islands, Rena is a true beachside sanctuary. Its modern architecture, nestled among palm trees, ensures luxury real estate with stunning vistas. The apartments and townhouses offer exceptional living, with expansive windows that frame breathtaking views of the shoreline.</p><p>Luxury amenities at Rena include spacious living areas, walk-in kitchens, and refined finishes. Enjoy uninterrupted views, private outdoor spaces, and exclusive features like a rooftop pool, sun deck, and state-of-the-art gym. Rena offers the perfect blend of relaxation, style, and functionality for those seeking a private coastal escape.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/feat_63d3c3f612.jpg","hash":"feat_63d3c3f612","name":"feat.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/banner_5168d39e08.jpg","hash":"banner_5168d39e08","name":"banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/15_d28fa8e7c4.jpg","hash":"15_d28fa8e7c4","name":"Rena by Avenew "},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/4_9bc85ad1bc.jpg","hash":"4_9bc85ad1bc","name":"Rena by Avenew "},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/2_7afc43cafe.jpg","hash":"2_7afc43cafe","name":"Rena by Avenew "},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/14_01b4f516fd.jpg","hash":"14_01b4f516fd","name":"Rena by Avenew "},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/11_85236eb15c.jpg","hash":"11_85236eb15c","name":"Rena by Avenew "},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/9_b1645ae80d.jpg","hash":"9_b1645ae80d","name":"Rena by Avenew "},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/12_f9a1ec45ad.jpg","hash":"12_f9a1ec45ad","name":"Rena by Avenew "},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/13_52de2ca37a.jpg","hash":"13_52de2ca37a","name":"Rena by Avenew "},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/10_78dfed5d8e.jpg","hash":"10_78dfed5d8e","name":"Rena by Avenew "},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/5_79939927ce.jpg","hash":"5_79939927ce","name":"Rena by Avenew "},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/8_844073ca71.jpg","hash":"8_844073ca71","name":"Rena by Avenew "},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/7_80eff18070.jpg","hash":"7_80eff18070","name":"Rena by Avenew "},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/6_59