ments or 2-bedroom duplex townhouses, blending modern luxury with coastal living.</li><li>Contemporary Design: Thoughtfully crafted to maximize natural light and panoramic coastal vistas, ensuring an elevated living experience.</li><li>Luxury Amenities: Features like walk-in kitchens, expansive terraces, a rooftop pool, and a state-of-the-art gym for ultimate relaxation and convenience.</li><li>Dubai Islands Prestige: Located in one of Dubai’s most sought-after coastal developments, offering tranquility and easy access to the city’s vibrant lifestyle.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1245,"cta":{"id":2011,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/map_52c30b7eff.jpg","hash":"map_52c30b7eff","name":"Rena by Avenew Location Map"},"style":null,"title":"A PRIME ISLAND LOCATION: PRESTIGIOUS, PRIVATE, PERFECTLY CONNECTED","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>The location of Rena at Dubai Islands offers a unique coastal escape, nestled on the stunning Dubai Islands. This prime location blends tranquility with dynamic city living, offering uninterrupted views of the sea and direct beach access. The Dubai Islands are home to world-class entertainment, luxury resorts, and waterfront activities. Rena apartments and townhouses are strategically located to maximize the beauty of this exclusive destination, providing residents with an unparalleled lifestyle in one of Dubai’s most sought-after beachfront locales.</p><p>16 Minutes to Dubai International Airport<br>24 Minutes to DIFC<br>26 Minutes to Downtown Dubai<br>26 Minutes to Dubai Mall</p>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":3424,"url":null,"file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Rena_by_AVENEW_Development_2024_Brochure_1038738af